{
  "about": "The capabilities a host enforces (PL-11) as boot.json carries them. cases: { acl (absent: boot.json has none, and everything is allowed), problem (the ACL is not one hosts can enforce: then every call is denied, fail-closed), checks: [plugin, item, window, allowed, scope or null ({ allow: entries or null, deny: entries })] }.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "problem": false,
      "checks": [["fs", "readFile", 1, true, null], ["anything", "at-all", 7, true, null]]
    },
